  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello.. this is my personal opinion about the recent update post as an avatar creator who normally works on quest the update that removes 3rd party programs seems not fair even though the reasoning behind it is understandable. There  are still crashers  in games, and what you did didn’t help but made people who wants to make high quality, good looking content for vrchat more miserable, and makes things difficult. Please  just change the quest limits so we wouldn’t  have to use third party programs to make quest avatars and worlds thats is my concern. Thank you.",
